# Cloudflare Pages routing — serve the single-page app shell for every
# section route so direct visits, refreshes, and shared links to
# e.g. /quran or /prayer-times load correctly instead of 404ing.
# The app's own router (see index.html) then shows the right section
# based on the URL. Kept as explicit routes (not a catch-all /*) so
# genuinely missing paths still 404 as expected.

/find-a-mosque   /index.html   200
/prayer-times    /index.html   200
/quran           /index.html   200
/journal         /index.html   200
/dua-dhikr       /index.html   200
/guides          /index.html   200
